  - m_Id: 13410486567211013
    m_Localized: Ban Jalae 2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13410486567211014
    m_Localized: 'Thought to begin as a brick stupa, this monument at ancient Yarang
      was later adapted as a worship hall, with a front hall and a room for a sacred
      image.


      <b>Restored model:</b> explore a possible complete building.
      Its roof and upper details interpret parts that no longer survive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13410486567211015
    m_Localized: Ban Jalae 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13410486567211016
    m_Localized: 'A Buddhist brick monument at ancient Yarang, built in two phases.
      The first is dated to around the 7th century CE. Votive tablets and miniature
      stupas found inside show its religious role.


      <b>Restored model:</b>
      explore a possible form above the stepped base. The lost upper structure is
      interpreted, rather than an exact replica.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13410486567211017
    m_Localized: Ban Jalae 8
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13410486567211018
    m_Localized: 'A west-facing brick monument at ancient Yarang, interpreted as
      the complex''s main shrine. Its square base has a central chamber and sandstone
      corner-column bases.


      <b>Restored model:</b> imagine the missing upper
      building. The books propose timber corner columns; its upper form, colour and
      details remain interpretations.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13410486567211019
    m_Localized: Ban Wat 9
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13410486567211020
    m_Localized: 'Interpreted as a Buddhist monument at ancient Yarang. Excavation
      revealed a brick base with eastern and western stairs and rooms above it. Finds
      include a stucco elephant and beads.


      <b>Restored model:</b> visualize
      a possible complete structure above the surviving base. Its upper form and
      decoration are reconstructed interpretations.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13458397711732736
    m_Localized: MAIN ATTRACTION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
